//━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
// 10. INSTANT TRAIL — SADECE GORSEL ETIKET [REV-33]
// +%6.50 lehte hareket: aktif | lehte zirve/dipten %0.15 geri donus: 1 etiket
// Emir/exit/alert YOK. Yalnizca mevcut gercek pozisyonu takip eder.
// OHLC belirsizliginde LONG O-L-H-C, SHORT O-H-L-C muhafazakar siralama.
//━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
var int   visTrailDir   = 0
var float visTrailPeak  = na
var bool  visTrailArmed = false
var bool  visTrailDone  = false
bool visTrailLong  = false
bool visTrailShort = false

if barstate.isconfirmed
    if realPos == 0
        visTrailDir   := 0
        visTrailPeak  := na
        visTrailArmed := false
        visTrailDone  := false
    else
        if realPos != visTrailDir
            visTrailPeak  := strategy.position_avg_price
            visTrailArmed := false
            visTrailDone  := false
        if not visTrailDone and not na(visTrailPeak)
            if realPos == 1
                // Onceki barlarda aktifse mevcut stop seviyesine LOW dokunusu yeterli.
                priorHit = visTrailArmed and low <= visTrailPeak * 0.9985
                visTrailPeak := math.max(visTrailPeak, high)
                visTrailArmed := visTrailArmed or visTrailPeak >= strategy.position_avg_price * 1.065
                // Bu bar ilk kez aktiflesmisse ayni bar icin HIGH sonrasi CLOSE geri donusunu teyit et.
                sameBarHit = visTrailArmed and close <= visTrailPeak * 0.9985
                if priorHit or sameBarHit
                    visTrailLong := true
                    visTrailDone := true
            else
                priorHit = visTrailArmed and high >= visTrailPeak * 1.0015
                visTrailPeak := math.min(visTrailPeak, low)
                visTrailArmed := visTrailArmed or visTrailPeak <= strategy.position_avg_price * 0.935
                sameBarHit = visTrailArmed and close >= visTrailPeak * 1.0015
                if priorHit or sameBarHit
                    visTrailShort := true
                    visTrailDone := true
        visTrailDir := realPos

plotshape(visTrailLong, title="INSTANT TRAIL LONG +6.5/-0.15", style=shape.labeldown,
     location=location.abovebar, color=color.orange, text="INSTANT", textcolor=color.white, size=size.tiny)
plotshape(visTrailShort, title="INSTANT TRAIL SHORT +6.5/-0.15", style=shape.labelup,
     location=location.belowbar, color=color.orange, text="INSTANT", textcolor=color.white, size=size.tiny)